{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "164", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "closely following which new products or ingredients are trending on social", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7717147083221453, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "media and are particularly interested in what well-known chefs are putting", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7720023933425216, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on their menus. I'd like to look at a few examples of marketing campaigns", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7713258311723636, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "which were really successful in launching a new fashion trend. Starting in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7720871814793182, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the 1990s with the avocado, a British PR company was hired to raise its", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "profile and stimulate demand. They paid for a group of journalists to travel", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7712825656418579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "out to South Africa to meet avocado farmers. Articles written following this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "visit helped to educate the British public about the avocado, which at this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.7715828612315523, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "time was certainly not the daily staple it's since become. Advertisements", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7713479765623854, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "were designed to promote the avocado as a superfood rich in nutrients and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.771543594174245, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "therefore beneficial for health. Avocados became hugely fashionable. And", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7719338041484262, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "within a few years, UK avocado sales had grown from 13 million pounds", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.7766814271842659, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "annually to around 150 million, making it one of the most successful", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7711738891908249, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fresh produce campaigns in UK history. Oat milk is a recent example of a new", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7721511570504924, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "product which became fashionable very quickly. Now there are many brands", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7717177840707594, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "available but one company which had early success was the Swedish brand", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.7714348151982582, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Oatley. They attracted a lot of attention with a media campaign which used", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "provocation as a way of getting their message across effectively. The fact", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7717462860079172, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that this campaign aggravated competitors. Producing milk from dairy cows", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7717178865957133, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "was seen as a plus as it helped to make oat milk seem cool. In the USA, the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.7713043009320646, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "brand decided against a big retail launch in favor of getting the product into", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.7721067637454949, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "coffee chains, which removed the need for a big advertising budget. This", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.7713695068026845, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "proved far more effective than offering samples in supermarkets. Oat milk", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "had an advantage over other alternative milk products such as almond milk.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5582986384538816, "w": 0.7715654319894055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Many consumers prefer it because it has less of an impact on the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5771360983315225, "w": 0.7716358666326694, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "environment. It requires significantly less water to produce than other", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5959735582091633, "w": 0.7713044034570185, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "alternative milk products and it also has a relatively low carbon footprint.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.7715002261187857, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Norwegian skrei, a rarely available seasonal fish delicacy, otherwise known", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6337967984797978, "w": 0.772031100329587, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "as Arctic cod, is now found on the menus of Michelin starred restaurants", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6526343338002236, "w": 0.7713913446178449, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "throughout Europe. The demand for skrei has been used by a food marketing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6715088360853101, "w": 0.7718921790171814, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "agency to build the reputation of Norway's fisheries in general. Marketing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6904946164783037, "w": 0.7714132849579591, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "surveys have shown that a significant number of shoppers now associate", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7093321517987295, "w": 0.7714785933535327, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Norway with excellent seafood. Food trends can be considered a good thing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7281696116763704, "w": 0.7716526807250934, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in some ways as they can benefit farmers and food producers enormously.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7470070715540112, "w": 0.7715654319894055, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "The public can also be encouraged to buy things which are more sustainably", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7659929273897897, "w": 0.7720061867658125, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "produced. But ethical concerns have been raised about the effects a surge", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7848303872674306, "w": 0.7714786958784866, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in demand can cause. Quinoa is a classic example. This plant is native to Peru.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8036678471450714, "w": 0.7717617672759417, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "And when demand peaked some years ago, the price soared, making it", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.822653627538065, "w": 0.7713475664625702, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "unaffordable for local people. While the popularity of quinoa has benefited", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8414910874157059, "w": 0.7716734932907158, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "farmers financially, there have been other negative consequences. As", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8603532925268339, "w": 0.7715220639339461, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "demand grew, farmers began working the land all year round in order to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8791907524044748, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "produce more quinoa. One issue has been that the fertility of the soil", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8981765327974682, "w": 0.7720980491244215, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "decreased dramatically which could potentially lead to desertification in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9170139926751091, "w": 0.7715655345143593, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "some areas. Another example would be the case of....", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.935851527995535, "w": 0.5475967484415951, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}